.TH MCP-TERMINAL-INFO 1 "@VERSION@" "mcp-terminal-docker" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mcp-terminal-info \- show MCP Terminal host integration summary
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mcp-terminal-info
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints host user, published port, configuration and data paths, Docker service
image reference, container state, and systemd unit status for the
\fBmcp-terminal-docker\fR package.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mcp-terminal-config (5),
.BR mcp-terminal-docker (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Vasiliy Zdanovskiy <vasilyvz@gmail.com>
